{
  "total_duration": 643.63,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.48,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果一座火山正在喷发，你会靠近它吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 3.83,
      "end": 5.91,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "大多数人当然会离远一点。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 6.26,
      "end": 12.9,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是火山科学家有一个很难的任务：他们要靠近事实，也要尊重危险。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 13.25,
      "end": 20.21,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Tazieff 拍照、测温、观察岩浆；当岩浆逼近时，他也及时撤退。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 20.56,
      "end": 27.375,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天我们抓住一个核心感觉："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "manage to do something"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，困难很大，但设法做到了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 27.725,
      "end": 31.485,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先认识这个人和他的研究对象。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 31.835,
      "end": 37.795,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Tazieff 一生研究世界各地的活火山和很深的洞穴。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 38.145,
      "end": 43.861,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "has spent his lifetime studying active volcanoes and deep caves"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 44.211,
      "end": 53.427,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Active volcanoes"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是安静的普通山，而是可能喷发、释放热量和气体的火山。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 53.777,
      "end": 61.297,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "他不是为了刺激才靠近危险，而是为了 observe, photograph, measure，拿到真实证据。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 61.646,
      "end": 69.222,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "has spent his lifetime, active volcanoes, deep caves, in all parts of the world"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 69.572,
      "end": 73.692,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧，故事来到一九四八年的 Central Africa。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 74.042,
      "end": 80.682,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：他来到刚果的 Lake Kivu，观察一座后来被命名为 Kituro 的新火山。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 81.032,
      "end": 86.22,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "he went to Lake Kivu in the Congo to observe a new volcano"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 86.57,
      "end": 91.73,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "火山正在猛烈喷发，可是 Tazieff 仍然在近处扎营观察。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 92.08,
      "end": 99.68,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文的关键句是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "was able to set up his camp very close to the volcano while it was erupting violently"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 100.029,
      "end": 107.133,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Lake Kivu, the Congo, Kituro, set up his camp, erupting violently"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 107.483,
      "end": 110.803,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧，危险真正靠近了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 111.153,
      "end": 120.473,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：他设法拍到精彩照片，但不能久留，因为一股液态岩石向他流来，几乎要包围他。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 120.823,
      "end": 128.627,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Though he managed to take a number of brilliant photographs, he could not stay near the volcano for very long"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 128.977,
      "end": 135.873,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A river of liquid rock"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是水河，而是熔岩一样的液态岩石。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 136.223,
      "end": 141.57,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "它"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "threatened to surround him completely"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，所以 Tazieff 必须撤退。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 141.92,
      "end": 150.48,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "managed to take photographs, could not stay, liquid rock, managed to escape just in time"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 150.83,
      "end": 154.83,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧，火山平静以后，他又回来了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 155.18,
      "end": 161.38,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：两天后，他返回 Kituro，进入火山口拍照并测量温度。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 161.73,
      "end": 165.694,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "he was able to return two days later"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 166.044,
      "end": 173.248,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "又说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "he managed to climb into the mouth of Kituro so that he could take photographs and measure temperatures"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 173.597,
      "end": 179.565,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The mouth of Kituro"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是火山口，不是真正的嘴。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 179.915,
      "end": 188.667,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "became quiet, was able to return, mouth of Kituro, measure temperatures, more about active volcanoes"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 189.017,
      "end": 195.444,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，为什么科学家要靠近正在喷发的火山？这不是太危险了吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 195.793,
      "end": 204.593,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "危险是真的，所以不能把它说成好玩。科学家靠近，是为了观察、拍照、测温，得到直接 evidence。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 204.943,
      "end": 207.893,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那 Tazieff 是不是只靠勇敢？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 208.243,
      "end": 216.243,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不只是 brave。他先观察，设法拍照；危险逼近时，他离开；火山平静后，他再回来。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 216.593,
      "end": 219.192,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以真正重要的是 judgment？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 219.541,
      "end": 225.341,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。科学探索不是一直往前冲，而是在 ability 和 danger 之间判断。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 225.691,
      "end": 232.064,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Manage to"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "was able to"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "有什么不同？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 232.414,
      "end": 242.038,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Was able to"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "说明在一个具体情况里做到了；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "managed to"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "更强调困难很大，但成功完成。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 242.388,
      "end": 248.09,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "比如"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "managed to take photographs"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，说明拍照片不容易？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 248.44,
      "end": 254.679,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。还有"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "managed to escape just in time"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，说明逃出来很惊险。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 255.029,
      "end": 258.775,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天的科学家还会这样靠近火山吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 259.125,
      "end": 268.365,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "有时仍要 fieldwork，但现代科学会尽量更安全：drones, remote sensors, thermal cameras, safety teams。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 268.715,
      "end": 271.209,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以勇气不是不怕危险。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 271.559,
      "end": 280.159,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Exactly. Real courage means doing careful work near a difficult truth, and stepping back when danger comes too close."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 280.509,
      "end": 288.021,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Haroun Tazieff, the Polish scientist, has spent his lifetime studying active volcanoes and deep caves in all parts of the world."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 288.37,
      "end": 295.09,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In 1948, he went to Lake Kivu in the Congo to observe a new volcano which he later named Kituro."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 295.44,
      "end": 301.224,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Tazieff was able to set up his camp very close to the volcano while it was erupting violently."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 301.574,
      "end": 307.862,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Though he managed to take a number of brilliant photographs, he could not stay near the volcano for very long."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 308.212,
      "end": 312.244,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He noticed that a river of liquid rock was coming towards him."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 312.594,
      "end": 317.85,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It threatened to surround him completely, but Tazieff managed to escape just in time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 318.2,
      "end": 323.576,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He waited until the volcano became quiet and he was able to return two days later."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 323.926,
      "end": 330.358,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "This time, he managed to climb into the mouth of Kituro so that he could take photographs and measure temperatures."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 330.708,
      "end": 334.092,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Tazieff has often risked his life in this way."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 334.441,
      "end": 339.241,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He has been able to tell us more about active volcanoes than any man alive."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 339.591,
      "end": 342.463,
      "speaker": "A",
